# Think for Yourself, intro (figure 80.2)
# Pollack's beat count is kept as a words row. The "-triplet-" marked under beats 3-4 of bar 2:
# G G G# as slow triplets (2/3 beat each), leading up to the A that begins the verse.
key G

system
words "Beats"  | 1 2 3 4 | 1 2 3 4 | 1 |
bass "Bass"    | G2{I} G2 G2 G2 | G2{-}*1 G2*1 G2*2/3 G2*2/3 G#2*2/3 | A2 |
